      "cooked": "<p>I’m creating Item Quotation for customers And I want section wise entry in item child table under Quotation i have multiple n number of Zones such as  Zone A (for kitchen), Zone B (for Wardrobes) &amp; C (for etc ) , in each Zone there are separate item entries and i want separate subtotal for each Zone and a total of all Zone A+B+C … = Total Costin the Summary at the bottom of the quotation.</p>\n<p>I Should be Able to add n number of items in each Zone and Also Increase or decrease the Zone.</p>\n<p>These are some Zones and there Sub total.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/c/3cb828a388935d516c218b55b5f0d290b0d3d7c0.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/3cb828a388935d516c218b55b5f0d290b0d3d7c0\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/c/3cb828a388935d516c218b55b5f0d290b0d3d7c0.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"8F9cNRhPr45fWjsuJ24xyAdBKso\" width=\"689\" height=\"234\" data-dominant-color=\"E2E4E3\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1237×421 22.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Final All Zone Total :-</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/8/f85fb6efcdfadfbfc92de498e5d53a93918469db.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"zrdtM4KNyBJ2Ef7KKKekn4IB7J1\" width=\"291\" height=\"97\"></p>",
