      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/abubakar_falah\">@Abubakar_Falah</a></p>\n<p>The form itself can not record based on item grouping;</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/8/f827c4688c0803751dfe70f98b084cf720eb23b3.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/f827c4688c0803751dfe70f98b084cf720eb23b3\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/8/f827c4688c0803751dfe70f98b084cf720eb23b3_2_690x327.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"zphC2tCU8I445zpamW2ESWdo6Cn\" width=\"690\" height=\"327\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/8/f827c4688c0803751dfe70f98b084cf720eb23b3_2_690x327.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/8/f827c4688c0803751dfe70f98b084cf720eb23b3_2_1035x490.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/8/f827c4688c0803751dfe70f98b084cf720eb23b3_2_1380x654.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBF9EC\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1806×858 69.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>But print format can group items to present the quotation the way you want it.</p>\n<p>It can be easily achieved by grouping based on item group within print format as following;</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/a/fa25564e70eccea447bc2d219f1c23fe97e6a116.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/fa25564e70eccea447bc2d219f1c23fe97e6a116\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/a/fa25564e70eccea447bc2d21